Title:		Acculogic ISApport and NCR53c406a SCSI driver
Version:        0.9
Entered-date:   9SEP94
Description:	This is an alpha SCSI driver for the Acculogic ISApport
		SCSI card.  It should also work on other SCSI cards based on
		the NCR53c406a chip.
Keywords:       SCSI, driver, NCR53c406a, ISApport, Acculogic
Author:         saumanis@cps.msu.edu (Normunds Saumanis)
Maintained-by:  saumanis@cps.msu.edu (Normunds Saumanis)
Primary-site:   tsx-11.mit.edu /pub/linux/ALPHA/scsi
		6632 ncr53c406-0.9.patch.gz
		2113 ncr53c40-0.9.README
Alternate-site: sunsite.unc.edu /pub/Linux/kernel/patches/scsi
		6632 ncr53c406-0.9.patch.gz
		2113 ncr53c406-0.9.README
